nnerVpn:"Tip: you can always use a VPN to China/Japan instead of the proxy.",proxyBannerDonate:"Donate",proxyBannerYomuAd:"From the maker of よむ Yomu — Japanese reader for web, manga, PDFs & subtitles",apiProxyUrl:"ASMR API Proxy URL",apiProxyUrlSub:"Cloudflare Worker used as a fallback when the API is unreachable or region-blocked. Leave blank to use the built-in proxy.",dlsiteProxy:"DLsite Proxy",dlsiteProxySub:"URL of your Cloudflare Worker proxy to bypass region blocks",dlsiteProxySetup:"Setup Guide",apiServer:"API Server",apiServerSub:"Select the ASMR.one API server (mirror)",dlsiteProxyUrl:"Proxy URL",dlsiteProxyUrlSub:"Unlocks DLsite comments and metadata restricted to Japan. Setup is free and easy.",dlsiteProxyUrlSetup:"View Full Setup Guide",dlsiteProxyFullGuide:'<h4>Cloudflare Proxy Setup Guide</h4><p>1. Go to <a href="https://dash.cloudflare.com/" target="_blank" class="text-primary asmr-settings-link">Cloudflare Dashboard</a> and login.</p><p>2. Navigate to <b>Compute & AI</b> > <b>Workers & Pages</b> and click <b>Create</b>.</p><p>3. Name it <code>dlsite-proxy</code> and click <b>Deploy</b>.</p><p>4. Click <b>Edit Code</b>, delete the default "Hello World" code, and paste the block below.</p><p>5. Click <b>Deploy</b> (top-right).</p><p>6. Go to <b>Settings</b> > <b>General</b> > <b>Placement</b>. Select <b>Region</b>, set provider to <b>Microsoft Azure</b>, and region to <b>japaneast</b>.</p><p>7. Copy the worker URL and paste it into the Proxy URL field.</p>',dlsiteProxyWorkerCode:"Worker Proxy Code",copyCode:"Copy Code",copied:"Copied!",magicSearch:"Semantic Search",magicSearchBtn:"Semantic Search",magicSearchPlaceholder:"Describe functionality (e.g. 'relaxing')...",magicSearchGo:"Search",magicSearchPrev:"Prev",magicSearchNext:"Next",magicSearchReady:"Ready.",magicSearchSearching:"Searching...",magicSearchSearchingJP:"Searching (JP translation applied)...",magicSearchPreparing:"Preparing search...",magicSearchNoMatches:"No matches found.",magicSearchNo